A man of the Cushites living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.10.7; 
 son of: Cush (H3568); 
 brother of: Seba (H5434), Havilah (H2341H), Sabtah (H5454), Raamah (H7484) and Nimrod (H5248) 
 § Sabtecha = "striking"
 the 5th son of Cush

A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.7.39; 
 son of: Shual (H7777B); 
 brother of: Arah (H0733) and Hanniel (H2592H) 
 § Rezia = "delight"
 an Asherite of the sons of Ulla
